    "The720-stride EP branch is present in matched stable native DCI, native UHD and full width. No new unique full-width-recording branch is established; no active EP bypass/disable A/B was performed.",
    "Full width has446new+45added=491encoded frames, exactly matching native source totals and decoded MP4. Fixed30p video timestamps compress video duration relative to the audio wall clock.",
    "The IRQ43 timing/multiplicity fits input cadence. Two events in a slower request are not evidence of a failed SRAM-load retry.",
    "The sustained ordinary-frame gap remains after excluding the ten-frame peak. A peak-only change cannot restore30newfps.",
    "DDR bandwidth contention and internal IPC/EP/HEVC backpressure remain unresolved. No passive latched-pending hit, per-block progress, or actual concurrent DDR bandwidth measurement establishes which one is causal."
